{
  "_readme": [
    "Golden JWT/cookie compatibility fixtures for the token package.",
    "Minted by this very code at commit 572dcaa5b2a0 (the version BCM and admin_api pin) before the",
    "OAuth handshake-cookie change. compat_test.go asserts that Token, Parse, Set, Reset and Get",
    "still mint and parse every token identically and emit byte-identical Set-Cookie headers.",
    "If a change makes this file need regenerating, that change signs every logged-in user out on",
    "deploy and breaks the rolling-deploy skew with instances still running the old code. Do not",
    "regenerate: fix the code."
